<title>UK: UK's Telewest says reviewing operations.</title>
<headline>UK's Telewest says reviewing operations.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Telewest Communications Plc said on Tuesday it was carrying out an operational review that was expected to reduce costs while it continued to build customer base and revenues.  </p>
<p>Press reports have recently speculated a merger between Telewest and Cable &amp; Wireless Communications Plc, something which has not been denied categorically by Telewest.</p>
<p>Its share price rose 3-1/2 pence to 77-1/2 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The company said it would announce further details of the review while announcing its half-year results.</p>
<p>---London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
